@ Diagnostics: log the name of any archive the game looks up but never loaded.
@ 0x008226EC is the archive manager's getFile (sub_608226EC); its entry is
@ `push {r4-r11, lr}`, position-independent, so the trampoline can replay it.

ArchiveGuard_getFile:
    type:       hook
    address:    0x008226EC
    symbol:     ModBase::archiveGuard::getFile(void*, void*, void*, unsigned int*)
    trampoline: ModBase::archiveGuard::getFile_orig(void*, void*, void*, unsigned int*)
